        {
            "block_label": "paragraph_title",
            "block_content": "1. University-Convened Meetings",
            "block_bbox": [
                183,
                759,
                616,
                790
            ],
            "block_id": 6,
            "block_order": 7,
            "group_id": 6,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    183.0,
                    759.0
                ],
                [
                    616.0,
                    759.0
                ],
                [
                    616.0,
                    790.0
                ],
                [
                    183.0,
                    790.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "a. If the University convenes a meeting involving the parties to a grievance for the purposes of resolving the grievance and/or completing the steps of the Grievance Procedure, the grievant(s), witness(es), if any, and AFSCME-designated employee representative(s) eligible to attend such meeting pursuant to this Article and Article 1 - Access/Union Rights Section C shall be in without-loss-of-straight-time-pay status during the meeting, provided:",
            "block_bbox": [
                252,
                815,
                1121,
                1013
            ],
            "block_id": 7,
            "block_order": 8,
            "group_id": 7,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    252.0,
                    815.0
                ],
                [
                    1121.0,
                    815.0
                ],
                [
                    1121.0,
                    1013.0
                ],
                [
                    252.0,
                    1013.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "1) Such meeting occurs during the regularly scheduled hours of work of the grievant(s), AFSCME-designated employee representative, and/or witness(es); and",
            "block_bbox": [
                327,
                1035,
                1119,
                1123
            ],
            "block_id": 8,
            "block_order": 9,
            "group_id": 8,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    327.0,
                    1035.0
                ],
                [
                    1119.0,
                    1035.0
                ],
                [
                    1119.0,
                    1123.0
                ],
                [
                    327.0,
                    1123.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "2) Advance request is made and approval is received from the supervisor of the grievant(s), the witness(es), and/or the AFSCME-designated employee representative. Approval to attend shall be made on an operational needs basis and shall not be unreasonably denied.",
            "block_bbox": [
                324,
                1146,
                1121,
                1288
            ],
            "block_id": 9,
            "block_order": 10,
            "group_id": 9,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    324.0,
                    1146.0
                ],
                [
                    1121.0,
                    1146.0
                ],
                [
                    1121.0,
                    1288.0
                ],
                [
                    324.0,
                    1288.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "3) A grievant or the representative may request the availability of bargaining unit employee witnesses for University-convened grievance meetings. The availability of bargaining unit employee witnesses shall be determined by their immediate supervisor(s) on the basis of operational needs, and such requests shall not be denied unreasonably. Witnesses shall be in a without-loss-of-straight-time-pay status only for time spent at the campus/hospital/laboratory meetings as a witness and reasonable travel time spent at the witness' respective campus/hospital/laboratory location. In instances where the witness' testimony is valuable and relevant to a grievant's case, paid release time for travel and testimony will not be unreasonably denied. Grievants and AFSCME agree that every effort shall be made to provide witnesses that pertain solely to the subject matter and to avoid the presentation of repetitive witnesses and that the absence of any or all witnesses shall not require the meeting to be recessed or postponed.",
            "block_bbox": [
                325,
                1312,
                1122,
                1785
            ],
            "block_id": 10,
            "block_order": 11,
            "group_id": 10,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    325.0,
                    1312.0
                ],
                [
                    1122.0,
                    1312.0
                ],
                [
                    1122.0,
                    1785.0
                ],
                [
                    325.0,
                    1785.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "b. The University is not responsible for any travel or lodging expenses or any other expenses incurred by the representative, grievant or union witnesses.",
            "block_bbox": [
                254,
                1808,
                1121,
